slug: conversation-runtime
what: specs/conversation.md implemented on durable-waiting-on-a-person -
  Frame/Slot described by the caller, a Reply that is a choice rather
  than a string, and an intake driver that asks the next unanswered
  slot, re-asks once when a slot cannot read its answer, reads back
  before it is done, and carries no words in any language.
touches: okay-agent/src/main/scala/okay/agent/Conversation.scala (new),
  okay-agent/src/test/scala/okay/agent/TestConversation.scala (new),
  specs/conversation.md, BACKLOG.md
